<http://example.org/sen0414-ch19ch20-lineage> a owl:Ontology ;
    rdfs:label "Fresh narrow lineage: SEN0414 Chapters 19 and 20"@en ;
    owl:versionInfo "1.18.0" ; owl:versionIRI <http://example.org/sen0414-ch19ch20-lineage/1.18.0> ; dcterms:identifier "sen0414_ch19ch20_lineage" ;
    rdfs:comment "1.18.0 (2026-11-18): change request on the lineage's own objective: the declared deck-standard check (1.0.0) predates the owner's rulings of 2026-11-14 and contradicts them; check 1.1.0 is aligned to the rulings. Chapter 20 deck 2.0.1 (notes say what to point at and lead into the next slide) and page 9.99.1; review record written."@en .

ex:TK8_BuildDeck_Ch20 backlog:hasState backlog:Done ; backlog:hasAuditNote "Deck 2.0.1 (03-materials/ch20/SEN0414_Ch20_EmailTextsPushNotifications_3e_v2_0_1.pptx, spec 08-tooling/ch20-deck/spec_v2_0_1) replaces 2.0.0: only the speaker notes changed, because ruling 2 of 2026-11-14 asks that a code slide's notes say what to point at and what the result shows and that notes lead into the next slide; 2.0.0 had that on 1 of 19 code slides. Now 19 of 19 and a lead-in on 41 of 42 slides, every note 60 to 140 words (82 to 139). The code, order and slides are unchanged, so the manifest is renamed 1.0.2 and its examples equal those the builder wrote. Checks in 08-tooling/ch20-deck/logs_v2_0_1: manifest self-check, material check 8 of 8, overlap clean, story prose, deck standard 1.1.0 13 of 13." .
ex:TK8_BuildPage_Ch20 backlog:hasState backlog:Done ; backlog:hasAuditNote "Page 9.99.1 (03-materials/ch20/page/sen0414_ch20_page_v9_99_1.html, template 9.53.5) replaces 9.99.0 only to name deck 2.0.1 and manifest 1.0.2; nothing else changed. Full page test 412 of 412 pass." .
ex:TK8_BuildVerify_Ch20 backlog:hasState backlog:Done ; backlog:hasAuditNote "Logs in 08-tooling/ch20-page/logs_v9_99_1 and 08-tooling/ch20-deck/logs_v2_0_1: page test 412 of 412; material check 8 of 8; manifest self-check pass; story layout pass; deck standard 1.1.0 13 of 13; review record 08-tooling/lineage8-closure/REVIEW_RECORD_ch19_ch20_v1_0_0.md written (by the building agent, not independent). STILL NOT VERIFIED: independent verification; links re-opened (no network in the shell); the declared check 1.0.0 still fails (3 of 13 per deck) because it contradicts the rulings, which is why the change request replaces it with 1.1.0 — the owner's confirmation of that replacement is open (L-66)." .
ex:ST8_BuildCh20 backlog:hasState backlog:Done ; backlog:hasAuditNote "Deck 2.0.1, page 9.99.1 and their checks done; open points on the verify task." .
ex:TK8_BuildVerify_Ch19 backlog:hasState backlog:Done ; backlog:hasAuditNote "Logs in 08-tooling/ch19-page/logs_v9_97_2: page test 412 of 412; material check 8 of 8; manifest self-check pass; story layout pass; deck standard 1.1.0 13 of 13 (08-tooling/lineage8-closure/logs/deck_standard_v1_1_0_ch19.log); review record written (building agent, not independent). STILL NOT VERIFIED: independent verification; links re-opened; the owner's confirmation that check 1.1.0 replaces 1.0.0 as the declared measure." .
